{"id":"n55561-1-10","stage":4,"title":"매사 · 每事","scene":"情境对话","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n55561-1-10-1","ko":"엄마, 결혼 먼저 하고 공부는 나중에 할게요.","zh":"妈妈，我先结婚，学习就晚点再做吧。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"엄마,","meaning":"妈妈","explanation":"엄마：妈妈","readings":[{"term":"엄마","audio":"/audio/9498f9014908e2891f1f.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"67098","senseId":"1","lemma":"엄마","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"엄마","audio":"/audio/9498f9014908e2891f1f.mp3"}},{"text":"결혼","meaning":"结婚","explanation":"결혼：结婚","readings":[{"term":"결혼","audio":"/audio/da38b2d66ddadc4ca840.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"31665","senseId":"1","lemma":"결혼","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"결혼","audio":"/audio/da38b2d66ddadc4ca840.mp3"}},{"text":"먼저","meaning":"先","explanation":"먼저：先","readings":[{"term":"먼저","audio":"/audio/c1ddf2fcaeed84cd91ee.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"54840","senseId":"1","lemma":"먼저","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"먼저","audio":"/audio/c1ddf2fcaeed84cd91ee.mp3"}},{"text":"하고","meaning":"表示两个以上的并列或反复。","explanation":"하다：表示两个以上的并列或反复。；고：连接并列或先后的动作、状态；也用于 -고 있다 等搭配。","readings":[{"term":"하다","audio":"/audio/505de0a2f6be73fa7758.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"73277","senseId":"26","lemma":"하다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"하고","audio":"/audio/1a7140c02481d065b267.mp3"}},{"text":"공부는","meaning":"学习，读书","explanation":"공부：学习，读书；는：话题或对比助词。","readings":[{"term":"공부","audio":"/audio/c9b4aed6d54a88472fe8.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"36672","senseId":"1","lemma":"공부","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"공부는","audio":"/audio/9b97419fada8f066c750.mp3"}},{"text":"나중에","meaning":"之后","explanation":"나중：之后；에：格助词，表示时间、位置、去向、对象等；需结合整句理解。","readings":[{"term":"나중","audio":"/audio/b8922cba892bea4a603a.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62275","senseId":"2","lemma":"나중","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"나중에","audio":"/audio/a12252500035668f76c9.mp3"}},{"text":"할게요.","meaning":"做，干","explanation":"하다：做，干；ㄹ게요：向对方礼貌地表达自己的决定或承诺。","readings":[{"term":"하다","audio":"/audio/505de0a2f6be73fa7758.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"73277","senseId":"1","lemma":"하다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"할게요","audio":"/audio/4c64a4744f1b7d84309e.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"9498f9014908e289","term":"엄마","zh":"妈妈","audio":"/audio/9498f9014908e2891f1f.mp3","entryId":"67098","definition":"在非正式场合用于指称或称呼母亲。","pronunciation":["엄마"]},{"id":"da38b2d66ddadc4c","term":"결혼","zh":"结婚","audio":"/audio/da38b2d66ddadc4ca840.mp3","entryId":"31665","definition":"男性和女性在法律上成为夫妻。","pronunciation":["결혼"]},{"id":"c1ddf2fcaeed84cd","term":"먼저","zh":"先","audio":"/audio/c1ddf2fcaeed84cd91ee.mp3","entryId":"54840","definition":"在时间或顺序上领先。","pronunciation":["먼저"]},{"id":"505de0a2f6be73fa","term":"하다","zh":"表示两个以上的并列或反复。；做，干","audio":"/audio/505de0a2f6be73fa7758.mp3","entryId":"73277","definition":"表示两个以上的并列或反复。","pronunciation":["하다"]},{"id":"c9b4aed6d54a8847","term":"공부","zh":"学习，读书","audio":"/audio/c9b4aed6d54a88472fe8.mp3","entryId":"36672","definition":"通过学习学问或技术而获得知识。","pronunciation":["공부"]},{"id":"b8922cba892bea4a","term":"나중","zh":"之后","audio":"/audio/b8922cba892bea4a603a.mp3","entryId":"62275","definition":"先做别的事情后。","pronunciation":["나ː중"]}],"audio":"/audio/91398bb237b0a7fda9a0.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n55561-1-10-2","ko":"안 된다. 매사에 때가 있는 법이야.","zh":"不行。凡事都有合适的时机。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"안","meaning":"不","explanation":"안：不","readings":[{"term":"안","audio":"/audio/bc00bc8172c83d5fab70.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71372","senseId":"1","lemma":"안","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"안","audio":"/audio/bc00bc8172c83d5fab70.mp3"}},{"text":"된다.","meaning":"某个事情不被允许。主要用于反问句，或和否定副词连用。","explanation":"되다：某个事情不被允许。主要用于反问句，或和否定副词连用。；ㄴ다：平叙句末，常用于书面叙述、自言自语或非敬语表达。","readin